{"id":"b8b99ee9-4149-4bb2-81c5-3bb5ecb152b4","title":"Resolution Shards 1","slug":"resolution-shards-1","collectionSlug":"resolution-shards","collectionName":"Resolution Shards","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A highly pixelated, blocky shader effect dominated by flowing gradients in cool tones. The image displays a dynamic liquid-like distortion with sharp, mosaic-like pixel blocks of varying sizes, creating a fragmented appearance. Deep navy and black pixels form concentrated clusters in the center and right side, while bright cyan and light blue pixels create flowing, wave-like patterns that sweep diagonally across the composition from lower-left to upper-right. The pixelation scale varies dynamically, with larger blocks in some areas transitioning to smaller shards in others, creating depth and movement. The overall effect resembles molten liquid frozen into crystalline shards or a digital water surface captured mid-ripple. The color transitions are smooth within the gradient layer but abruptly stepped by the posterization effect, creating a stark contrast between the flowing organic gradients and the rigid geometric pixelation. The edges fade to transparency, giving the effect a soft boundary despite the hard-edged pixel blocks. The atmosphere is cool and technological, with a sense of kinetic energy and fluid motion despite the static nature of the pixelated blocks.","colors":["#008ddf","#4fffed","#215de9","#000000"],"labels":["gradient","geometric","retro","dark"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/b8b99ee9-4149-4bb2-81c5-3bb5ecb152b4.jpg","toneMapping":"cineon","components":[{"type":"FlowingGradient","id":"idmw55s9hg2tnm3x895","_key":"key_idmw55s9hg2tnm3x895","props":{"seed":12,"speed":0.2,"colorA":"#008ddf","colorB":"#4fffed","colorC":"#000000","colorD":"#215de9","opacity":1,"maskType":"alpha","blendMode":"normal","transform":{"edges":"transparent","scale":1,"anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"rotation":0},"colorSpace":"okl